{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":false,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":5,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":1017,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1900635,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":284000,"Name":"dahead","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1437120672,"LastPoster":{"Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":33,"Preview":{"Id":1900635,"PostDate":1437120672,"PostContent":"We are getting married in October 2016 and I although most things are sorted one of the areas I a...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"seemnoty@gmail.com","IpAddress":"98.126.51.58","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1437115554,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"dahead","Id":284000,"Name":"dahead","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":false,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"98.126.222.149","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79404,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"39e4e107b36c5b983d23f0a3f60d4e89","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;We are getting married in October 2016 and I although most things are sorted one of the areas I am really struggling to find are decent bridesmaid dresses for \u00a3100 or under per dress. The colours I am looking for are burnt orange and royal blue - naturally royal blue is easy to find but burnt orange is rather more difficult.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I have found lots of websites which offer a service where you can buy a dress custom made - looking like they come from China. I used to live in Hong Kong and so have had things made in China before and the quality is very good. I am worried though that if I go with one of these companies I will be parting with a lot of money but not getting anything or getting rubbish quality products.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;One of the websites I&#039;ve found is: &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.jueshegowns.co.uk\/&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.jueshegowns.co.uk\/&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Anyone used this place or any other internet custom making service?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1900635,"PostDate":1437120672,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>We are getting married in October 2016 and I although most things are sorted one of the areas I am really struggling to find are decent bridesmaid dresses for \u00a3100 or under per dress. The colours I am looking for are burnt orange and royal blue - naturally royal blue is easy to find but burnt orange is rather more difficult.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I have found lots of websites which offer a service where you can buy a dress custom made - looking like they come from China. I used to live in Hong Kong and so have had things made in China before and the quality is very good. I am worried though that if I go with one of these companies I will be parting with a lot of money but not getting anything or getting rubbish quality products.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>One of the websites I've found is: <a href='http:\/\/www.jueshegowns.co.uk\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.jueshegowns.co.uk\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Anyone used this place or any other internet custom making service?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"seemnoty@gmail.com","IpAddress":"98.126.51.58","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1437115554,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"dahead","Id":284000,"Name":"dahead","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"90.201.32.180","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79404,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b1a18bcfb7c7c6d0caf709fd5654d4de","RawContent":"Hi @[member=\"dahead\"], I&#039;d been having the same problem, (I&#039;m from the UK) and have been trying to find dresses that will fit all in my bridal party for a decent price. I was planning on getting dresses from China but then came across &lt;a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.forherandforhim.com\/\"&gt;http:\/\/www.forherandforhim.com\/&lt;\/a&gt; depending on how many dresses you have, a lot come in under \u00a3100 and they always seem to have sale! The great part for me is that they make custom dresses\/plus size\/maternity\/jr. Bridesmaid versions and even flower girl versions of the adult dress if you need it. They have plenty of colours to choose from. If you see a dress you like elsewhere, they are happy to quote you. It&#039;s the easiest option for me. I also love that they have a \"showroom\" section where you can add dresses that you love and then invite your bridesmaids who can comment on dresses and add ones they like....great way to narrow down options. Check out the real weddings page and you can see loads and loads of photos from brides who have sent photos of their bridesmaids, I haven&#039;t ordered mine yet but the quality does look good.\n\n\nI hope this helps. If you d happen to find any other good websites, please let me know [emoji4]","Attachments":[],"Id":1902179,"PostDate":1439133957,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"284000\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/284000-dahead\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">dahead<\/span><\/a>, I'd been having the same problem, (I'm from the UK) and have been trying to find dresses that will fit all in my bridal party for a decent price. I was planning on getting dresses from China but then came across <a href='http:\/\/www.forherandforhim.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.forherandforhim.com\/<\/a> depending on how many dresses you have, a lot come in under \u00a3100 and they always seem to have sale! The great part for me is that they make custom dresses\/plus size\/maternity\/jr. Bridesmaid versions and even flower girl versions of the adult dress if you need it. They have plenty of colours to choose from. If you see a dress you like elsewhere, they are happy to quote you. It's the easiest option for me. I also love that they have a \"showroom\" section where you can add dresses that you love and then invite your bridesmaids who can comment on dresses and add ones they like....great way to narrow down options. Check out the real weddings page and you can see loads and loads of photos from brides who have sent photos of their bridesmaids, I haven't ordered mine yet but the quality does look good.<br><br>\nI hope this helps. If you d happen to find any other good websites, please let me know [emoji4] \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ricardoandkershia@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"82.16.59.180","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1420514404,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"SunshineDreamKay","Id":281615,"Name":"SunshineDreamKay","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":false,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"74.126.178.2","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79404,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by dahead, 14 October 2015 - 07:58 PM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1444881499,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7810f8a517aeedaaed260267a6dc8b87","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"SunshineDreamKay\"] Thank for your suggestion :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1906280,"PostDate":1444881432,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281615\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281615-sunshinedreamkay\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">SunshineDreamKay<\/span><\/a> Thank for your suggestion <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"seemnoty@gmail.com","IpAddress":"98.126.51.58","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1437115554,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"dahead","Id":284000,"Name":"dahead","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"122.15.103.61","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79404,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1f517dd0807d70c352852fad6c31f33d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Lee Philip &lt;a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.leephilipbridals.com\/\" title=\"External link\"&gt;Page Title&lt;\/a&gt;\n\n\nNetbride &lt;a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.netbride.com\/\" title=\"External link\"&gt;Netbride - discount bridal gowns, wedding gowns, bridesmaid dresses&lt;\/a&gt;\n\n\nPerfect bridal &lt;a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.perfectbridal.com\/\" title=\"External link\"&gt;Wedding Dresses at Discount Prices&lt;\/a&gt;\n\n\nBest bridal prices &lt;a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestbridalprices.com\/\" title=\"External link\"&gt;Wedding Dresses, Prom Dresses, Wedding Accessories at BestBridalPrices.com&lt;\/a&gt;\n\n\nBridal elegance &lt;a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bridalelegance-eriepa.com\/\" title=\"External link\"&gt;Bridal Elegance&lt;\/a&gt;\n\n\nRK bridal &lt;a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/rkbridal.com\/localpages\/new_page_1.htm\" title=\"External link\"&gt;New Page 1&lt;\/a&gt;\n\ntoll-free: 800-929-9512\n\n\nChrissy Os &lt;a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.chrissyobridal.com\/index.htm\" title=\"External link\"&gt;Welcome to Chrissy O Fashion and Bridal Boutique!&lt;\/a&gt;\n\nRecommended by a knottie\n\n\nTJ formal &lt;a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.tjformal.com\/\" title=\"External link\"&gt;2008 Prom Dresses - Wedding Dresses - Bridemaids - Mother of the Bride Gowns&lt;\/a&gt; (google for a 10% off coupon)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1909034,"PostDate":1452079435,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Lee Philip <a href='http:\/\/www.leephilipbridals.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Page Title<\/a><br><br>\nNetbride <a href='http:\/\/www.netbride.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Netbride - discount bridal gowns, wedding gowns, bridesmaid dresses<\/a><br><br>\nPerfect bridal <a href='http:\/\/www.perfectbridal.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Wedding Dresses at Discount Prices<\/a><br><br>\nBest bridal prices <a href='http:\/\/www.bestbridalprices.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Wedding Dresses, Prom Dresses, Wedding Accessories at BestBridalPrices.com<\/a><br><br>\nBridal elegance <a href='http:\/\/www.bridalelegance-eriepa.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Bridal Elegance<\/a><br><br>\nRK bridal <a href='http:\/\/rkbridal.com\/localpages\/new_page_1.htm' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>New Page 1<\/a><br>\ntoll-free: 800-929-9512<br><br>\nChrissy Os <a href='http:\/\/www.chrissyobridal.com\/index.htm' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Welcome to Chrissy O Fashion and Bridal Boutique!<\/a><br>\nRecommended by a knottie<br><br>\nTJ formal <a href='http:\/\/www.tjformal.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>2008 Prom Dresses - Wedding Dresses - Bridemaids - Mother of the Bride Gowns<\/a> (google for a 10% off coupon)<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"priyamsharma73@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"122.15.103.61","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1450180104,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Priyam","Id":285595,"Name":"Priyam","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.50.15.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79404,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ef035769875291054f55995d0f65633b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@dahead&amp;nbsp; Congrats and welcome! You&#039;ve come to the right place for ideas and suggestions and the brides here are always happy to help.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Have you looked into David&#039;s Bridal? They ship internationally. If you go to&amp;nbsp;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.davidsbridal.com&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.davidsbridal.com&lt;\/a&gt;&amp;nbsp; and when the home page comes up, just select United Kingdom for the country and it will give you the pricing in pounds sterling. They have a ton of styles and I found a colour that is pretty close to burnt orange but you can take a look for yourself and see what they have. Their sizing is pretty good as far as accuracy so you could take your wedding party&#039;s measurements and see what works, and I found styles that were under \u00a3100. They have both long and short styles so a pretty good selection.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Good luck and happy planning!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1909081,"PostDate":1452139053,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@dahead\u00a0 Congrats and welcome! You've come to the right place for ideas and suggestions and the brides here are always happy to help.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Have you looked into David's Bridal? They ship internationally. If you go to\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/www.davidsbridal.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.davidsbridal.com<\/a>\u00a0 and when the home page comes up, just select United Kingdom for the country and it will give you the pricing in pounds sterling. They have a ton of styles and I found a colour that is pretty close to burnt orange but you can take a look for yourself and see what they have. Their sizing is pretty good as far as accuracy so you could take your wedding party's measurements and see what works, and I found styles that were under \u00a3100. They have both long and short styles so a pretty good selection.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Good luck and happy planning!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>I said \"yes\" again to the love of my life at Grand Coral Beach Club, Playa del Carmen, Mexico on our 4th anniversary - October 20, 2015<\/em><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/ann.chadwick.5\/media_set?set=a.10153262834771016.1073741828.569791015&type=3'><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/ann.chadwick.5\/media_set?set=a.10153262834771016.1073741828.569791015&type=3<\/em><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/'><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/<\/em><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283458999,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"79404","Title":"Who U Guys Know The Website","LastPostDate":1452139053},"Pages":{"TotalItems":5,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
